From 0df17dfc2051ae7497391870748c828e870024fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Benjamin Tan <benjamin@dev.ofcr.se>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0300
Subject: git: fetch and import raw refs

Code review systems expose commits through refs outside the branch and
tag namespaces. Some Git servers also let clients fetch full commit IDs

Add a one-shot fetch path for raw refs or full commit IDs. Import the
targets as visible heads without creating remote-tracking refs

Use a unique temporary ref for each fetched source. This keeps concurrent
fetches independent and preserves any existing internal refs

Refs #4388

Co-authored-by: 4evy <git@evy.pink>

